## 10. Suggested Build Order (for Cursor)

1. Firestore security rules + admin allowlist mechanism (§3, §5) — do this first, everything else depends on it being correct.
2. Data model + seed/mock data matching §4.
3. Investor Dashboard Home + Properties (read-only, simplest pages).
4. Admin Investor List + Investor Detail edit forms (unblocks real data for the investor side).
5. Analytics page wired to live data, replacing placeholders.
6. Calendar (multi-property, filterable).
7. Investor onboarding flow (§7.3) once the order decision is made.
8. Theme persistence to Firestore (if not already cross-device).
9. Auth/access-control audit pass: verify server-side route guarding and rule enforcement with real test accounts (one investor, one non-admin, one admin).

