## 11. Acceptance Checklist

- [ ] Investor A cannot read Investor B's data via SDK, rules, or UI.
- [ ] Non-admin authenticated user cannot access `/admin` routes (server-enforced, not just hidden nav).
- [ ] Admin edits to a property/booking/analytics entry appear in the investor's dashboard without a code change or redeploy.
- [ ] No screen in the investor dashboard shows hardcoded/demo data.
- [ ] Light/dark preference persists across devices for the same investor.
- [ ] New investor with no data sees a sensible empty state, not a broken/blank page.
- [ ] Admin can fully onboard a new investor (profile + at least one property) without touching code.